    "title": "Proper pruning training - NewsBreak",
    "text": "MARATHON — Monroe County Environmental Resources led a hands-on \"Pruning with Purpose\" training recently at the Marathon Government Center, designed to align field practices with local landscaping codes and national industry standards. The training focused on real-world pruning techniques that support public safety, infrastructure protection and the long-term health of vegetation, and included public works professionals from Monroe County, Islamorada and Marathon. To learn more about proper pruning techniques and local regulations, visit monroecounty-fl.gov/prune.",
